OL,3,AKing warns malicious online actors are
OL,4,Aevolving tactics
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III has warned of the
OL,7,Fchallenges disinformation and other
OL,8,F"hostile online activity" pose to trust
OL,9,Fand security in the digital age.
OL,11,FThe comments, made in a letter to the
OL,12,FNational Cyber Security Centre (NCSC)
OL,13,Fto mark its 10th anniversary, spoke of
OL,14,F"malicious actors" continuing to
OL,15,F"evolve their tactics by using
OL,16,Fautomated technologies".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
PN,10602
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F106A1791649458
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AKing warns malicious online actors are
OL,4,Aevolving tactics
OL,5,
OL,6,F"From threats to our international
OL,7,Forder, to the need to balance the risks
OL,8,Fand opportunities of powerful new
OL,9,Ftechnologies, strong cyber security is
OL,10,Ffundamental to making the online
OL,11,Fenvironment safer and more resilient,"
OL,12,Fhe wrote.
OL,14,FLast month, the King warned AI
OL,15,Fexecutives of the "existential dangers"
OL,16,Fposed by the technology falling into
OL,17,Fthe wrong hands.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
